  - file: Ramesses-Ptah-Sekhmet.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Ramesses-Ptah-Sekhmet.jpg/330px-Ramesses-Ptah-Sekhmet.jpg
