  - file: Bes-E_11554-IMG_0579-white_(cropped).jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Bes-E_11554-IMG_0579-white_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Bes-E_11554-IMG_0579-white_%28cropped%29.jpg
