  - file: Hathor-E_26023-IMG_4152-black_cropped.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Hathor-E_26023-IMG_4152-black_cropped.jpg/250px-Hathor-E_26023-IMG_4152-black_cropped.jpg
